  decidable check: in the boundary rows no expression depends on a wrapped
  read of a three-offset column, after folding preprocessed values at
  relative rows, cell facts and row facts.
- LiftW: w_b2msg, w_fpwalk, w_urec (L >= 5) by decide +kernel; hardW is now
  msg, sha, b2s, coin.
